{
  "text": "紫微斗數全書",
  "juan": "卷一",
  "section": "太微賦",
  "entries": [
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L000",
      "original_quote": "太微賦",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第2行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L001",
      "original_quote": "⽃數⾄⽞⾄微,理旨難明,雖設問於各篇之中,猶有⾔⽽未盡,⾄",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第3行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L002",
      "original_quote": "如星之分野,各有所屬,壽天賢愚,富貴貧賤,不可⼀概論議｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第4行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L003",
      "original_quote": "其星分佈⼀⼗⼆垣,數定乎三⼗六位,入廟為奇,失度為虛,⼤抵",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第5行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L004",
      "original_quote": "以⾝命為福德之本,加以根源為窮通之資｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第6行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L005",
      "original_quote": "星有同躔,數有分定,須明其⽣剋之要,必詳乎得垣失度之分｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第7行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L006",
      "original_quote": "觀乎紫微舍躔,司⼀天儀之象,率列宿⽽成垣,⼟星苟居其垣,若",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第8行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L007",
      "original_quote": "可移動,⾦星專司財庫,最怕空亡｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第9行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L008",
      "original_quote": "帝星動則列宿奔馳,貪守空⽽財源不聚｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第10行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L009",
      "original_quote": "各司其職,不可參差｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第11行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L010",
      "original_quote": "苟或不察其機,更忘其變,則數之造化遠矣｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第12行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L011",
      "original_quote": "例⽇",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第13行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L012",
      "original_quote": "祿逢沖破,吉處藏凶｡⾺遇空亡,終⾝奔走｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第14行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L013",
      "original_quote": "⽣逢敗地,發也虛花｡絕處逢⽣,⽣花不敗｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第15行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L014",
      "original_quote": "星臨廟旺,再觀⽣剋之機｡命坐強宮,細察制化之理｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第16行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L015",
      "original_quote": "⽇⽉最嫌反背,祿⾺最喜交馳｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第17行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L016",
      "original_quote": "倘居空亡,得失最為要緊｡若逢敗地,扶持⼤有奇功｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第18行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L017",
      "original_quote": "紫微天府全依輔弼之功,七殺破軍專依⽺鈴之虐｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第19行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L018",
      "original_quote": "諸星吉,逢凶也吉｡諸星凶,逢凶也凶｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第20行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L019",
      "original_quote": "輔弼夾帝為上品,桃花犯主為⾄淫｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第21行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L020",
      "original_quote": "君⾂慶會,材善經邦｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第22行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L021",
      "original_quote": "魁鉞同⾏,位居台輔｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第23行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L022",
      "original_quote": "祿⽂拱命,貴⽽且賢｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第24行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L023",
      "original_quote": "⽇⽉夾財,不權則富｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第25行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L024",
      "original_quote": "⾺頭帶劍,鎮衛邊疆｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第26行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L025",
      "original_quote": "刑求夾印,刑杖惟司｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第27行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L026",
      "original_quote": "善蔭朝綱,仁慈之長｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第28行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L027",
      "original_quote": "貴入貴鄉,逢之富貴｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第29行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L028",
      "original_quote": "財居財位,遇者富奢｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第30行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L029",
      "original_quote": "太陽居午,謂之⽇麗中天,有專權之貴,敵國之富｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第31行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L030",
      "original_quote": "太陰居⼦,號⽈⽔澄桂萼,得清要之職,忠諫之材｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第32行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L031",
      "original_quote": "紫微輔弼同宮,⼀呼百諾居上品｡⽂耗居寅卯,謂之眾⽔朝東｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第33行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L032",
      "original_quote": "⽇⽉守不如照合,蔭福聚不怕凶危｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第34行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L033",
      "original_quote": "貪居亥⼦,名為犯⽔桃花｡刑遇貪狼,號⽈風流綵杖｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第35行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L034",
      "original_quote": "七殺廉貞同位,路上埋屍｡破軍暗曜同鄉,⽔中作塚｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第36行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L035",
      "original_quote": "祿居奴僕縱有官也奔馳,帝遇凶徒雖獲吉⽽無道｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第37行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L036",
      "original_quote": "帝坐⾦⾞則⽇⾦轝捧櫛,福安⽂曜謂之⽟袖天香｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第38行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L037",
      "original_quote": "太陽會⽂昌於官祿,皇殿朝班,富貴全美｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第39行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L038",
      "original_quote": "太陰會⽂曲於妻宮,蟾宮折桂,⽂章全盛｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第40行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L039",
      "original_quote": "祿存守於⽥財,堆⾦積⽟｡財蔭坐於遷移,巨商⾼賈｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第41行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L040",
      "original_quote": "耗居祿位,沿途乞食｡貪會旺宮,終⾝鼠竊｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第42行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L041",
      "original_quote": "殺居絕地,天年天似顏回｡貪坐⽣鄉,壽考永如彭祖｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第43行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L042",
      "original_quote": "忌暗同居⾝命疾厄,沉困尪贏,凶星會於⽗⺟遷移,刑傷破祖｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第44行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L043",
      "original_quote": "刑殺同廉貞於官祿,枷扭難逃,官符加刑殺於遷移,離鄉遭配｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第45行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L044",
      "original_quote": "善福居空位,天竺⽣涯｡輔弼單守命宮,離宗庶出｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第46行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L045",
      "original_quote": "七殺臨於⾝命加惡殺,必定死亡｡鈴⽺合於命宮遇⽩虎,須當刑戮｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第47行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L046",
      "original_quote": "官府發於吉曜,流殺怕逢破軍｡⽺陀憑太歲以引⾏,病符官符皆作",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "太微賦",
        "line_ref": "第48行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_TaiweiFu_L047",
      "original_quote": "禍｡",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
